include locations/global
include locations/moradon
include translations/18004_kaisan

Bind Npc 18004 Zone 21

Quest 72 "Redistributions"
    Journal "[Grand Merchant] Kaishan performs redistributions."

On topics
    If player level >= 10
        Topic "Redistributions" goto event_407

On accept
    If player level >= 10
        Goto event_407

On event_407
    Say "Would you like to redistribute?"
    Topic "Redistribution will take place." do
        Open stats panel
    Topic "Close" goto close
